{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログ開いてくださりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "森平麗心です。"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobOKOjN5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "現在発売中の週刊少年マガジンさんで、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "初めて表紙を務めさせていただいています！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めて、本当にありがとうございます☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつか表紙を飾れる存在になりたいなと憧れていたので、こうして夢をひとつ叶えることができて幸せです；＿；"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mob3q0r2T.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🍃"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobFF922O.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう見てくださった方は、お気に入りのページや感想をぜひ教えてください✉️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まだの方も、手に取っていただけたら嬉しいです🫶🏻💭"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202606/mobbzHdFz.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もりひらうるみ🐱🌻"}], "source": "official"}